					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30010602,
					"content": "唔，你说她究竟是「大慈树王」，还是「小吉祥草王」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30010603,
