					"nextDialogs": [
						30010610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30010610,
					"content": "等一下，刚刚那是什么？是我的错觉吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30010611,
						30010613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30010611,
					"content": "果然你也看见了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30010612
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30010612,
					"content": "对呀！就是那种小小的、圆圆的、看起来还有点像蔬菜的小东西…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30010615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30010615,
					"content": "刚才真是吓了我一大跳，我觉得我们有必要打听一下这种东西是什么。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30010616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30010616,
					"content": "不过现在，我们先开始工作吧。我飞到上面去，你就负责擦下面好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30010617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30010617,
					"content": "和派蒙一起仔细擦拭了神像…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 30010613,
					"content": "是卷心菜吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30010614
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30010614,
					"content": "对对！小小的、圆圆的，的确有点像卷心菜。不过明显是活的呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30010615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30010605,
					"content": "「小吉祥草王」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
